'''Cyborg''' is one of three [[races]] that can be obtained through a quest.

Cyborg's special abilities allow the player to fight and combo more effectively in close quarters, by quickly draining [[Instinct]] or by dealing extra damage and increasing their own defense. This race is mainly used against teamers due to its ability to deal extremely effective wide-area damage. In general, this race is great for grinding, [[PvP]] against teamers and especially breaking combos. Additionally, it is also good for [[Instinct/Break|breaking Instinct]] and doing combos with Instinct-trickable attacks. However, the V3's average range is also a slight drawback, and the V4's damage output is not a good choice in 1v1s.

